e": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228547925", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119711816", "personaname": "Leon", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/notris/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 298, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 249, "last_played": 1782709116, "avatar": "1a5302f66db885285bae470fdf25a211a923befc"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm one of those scrubs who played [i]Risk of Rain 2[/i] before playing the original, aka the 99%.\n\nExcept I still haven't played the 'original' [i]RoR,[/i] instead opting for [i]Risk of Rain Returns,[/i] which has been described (perhaps accurately; I wouldn't know) as an all-around upgrade over the original [i]RoR.[/i]\n\nWell, upgrade or not, I can confidently state this game is great.\n\nIt's like [i]RoR 2[/i] with better graphics, worse gameplay, but significantly more dopamine-inducing moments. Arguably the best 2D shooter I've ever played.\n\nSome of the items would be absolutely bonkers to see in its sequel. Others, I'm glad were introduced into the first title after they had proven themselves in [i]Risk of Rain 2[/i]. It's really the best of both worlds.\n\nWill I ever play the original? Honestly... Probably not, because I have a feeling this is the ideal way to experience the risk associated with rain.\n\n9 / 10 — would get rained on again (except by the Magma worm; ♥♥♥♥ you, Magma Worm)", "timestamp_created": 1782108416, "timestamp_updated": 1782170587, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54519355297088623", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "hardware": {"system_ram": "16236", "os": "Windows 1